  "plan": "The whole of the matter is to be tried out once more by means of the simplest possible method. The two pairs which have been found of no use are to be put by and the thing is to be done over with a single one. The only means by which a result can possibly be got in the present state of things is to put every the value that the seed can give to the test. That result once more being brought to light the point at which the whole proceeding has been so long thrown off into the wrong will at the same time be made to appear. In the mean time there is nothing to be said or done but to put the thing to the trial and take the result that may be found to be given.",
